# MLOps Enforcement

## Pipeline

Stages: preprocess → enrich_metadata → feature_eng → train → evaluate → registry → inference

- Define stages in `dvc.yaml` with explicit deps/outs
- TMDB fetch cached under DVC; no API call every `dvc repro`
- Track data with DVC remote; commit `dvc.lock` only

## MLflow

Log params, metrics (Recall@K, Precision@K, NDCG@K, RMSE), artifacts every train run.
Registry: Staging → Production after evaluate passes.

## Docker

Multi-stage Dockerfile; docker-compose for app + mlflow (+ postgres optional).

## Reproducibility

`poetry install` or `uv sync` + `dvc repro` must work on clean machine per README.

See `.cursor/context/ml-pipeline.md` and `.cursor/context/deployment.md`.
